# MSIX packaging intermediates
BundleArtifacts/
*.assets.cache
UpgradeLog*.htm

# Local secrets. scripts\.env holds the Partner Center client secret used by submit-store.ps1 and
# must never be committed; .env.example is the value-free template and is tracked. Neither pattern
# has a slash, so both apply at any depth.
.env
!.env.example

# Per-user IDE state. The non-.user siblings are shared settings and stay tracked.
*.DotSettings.user
*.csproj.user
*.wapproj.user
*.pubxml.user